WEBVTT

00:15:59.866 --> 00:16:01.724
changes in social values

00:16:01.748 --> 00:16:04.006
and changes in people's behavior

00:16:04.143 --> 00:16:07.183
that work against
their own economic interests,

00:16:07.207 --> 00:16:10.385
but that may ultimately
restore the American dream.

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:12.640
Thank you.

00:16:12.664 --> 00:16:17.999
(Applause)